[{"latex":"\\begin{ex}%[6D1C5]\nSo sánh \n\na) $ 5^{200}$ và $ 2^{500}$\n\nb) $505^{202}$ và $202^{505}$\n\\loigiai{\na) $ 5^{200} = \\left( 5^{2} \\right)^{100}  = 25^{100}$\\\\\n$ 2^{500} = \\left( 2^{5} \\right)^{100}  =  32^{100}$\\\\\nVì $ 25 < 32$ nên $ 25^{100} < 32^{100} $ suy ra $ 5^{200} < 2^{500}$.\\\\\nb) $505^{202} = \\left( 505^{2} \\right)^{101}$\\\\\nTa có $505^{2}= 5^{2} \\cdot 101^{2} = 25 \\cdot 101^{2}$\\\\\n$202^{505} = \\left( 202^{5} \\right)^{101}$\\\\\nTa có $202^{5}= 2^{5} \\cdot 101^{5} = 32 \\cdot 101^{5}$\\\\\nVì $ 25 < 32$ nên $5^{2} \\cdot 101^{2} < 2^{5} \\cdot 101^{5}$\\\\\nSuy ra $505^{202} < 202^{505}$.\n}\\end{ex}","ans":""},{"latex":"\\begin{ex}%[6D1C5]\nSo sánh \n\na) $ 6^{300}$ và $ 3^{600}$\n\nb) $606^{303}$ và $303^{606}$\n\\loigiai{\na) $ 6^{300} = \\left( 6^{3} \\right)^{100}  = 216^{100}$\\\\\n$ 3^{600} = \\left( 3^{6} \\right)^{100}  =  729^{100}$\\\\\nVì $ 216 < 729$ nên $ 216^{100} < 729^{100} $ suy ra $ 6^{300} < 3^{600}$.\\\\\nb) $606^{303} = \\left( 606^{3} \\right)^{101}$\\\\\nTa có $606^{3}= 6^{3} \\cdot 101^{3} = 216 \\cdot 101^{3}$\\\\\n$303^{606} = \\left( 303^{6} \\right)^{101}$\\\\\nTa có $303^{6}= 3^{6} \\cdot 101^{6} = 729 \\cdot 101^{6}$\\\\\nVì $ 216 < 729$ nên $6^{3} \\cdot 101^{3} < 3^{6} \\cdot 101^{6}$\\\\\nSuy ra $606^{303} < 303^{606}$.\n}\\end{ex}","ans":""},{"latex":"\\begin{ex}%[6D1C5]\nSo sánh \n\na) $ 5^{300}$ và $ 3^{500}$\n\nb) $505^{303}$ và $303^{505}$\n\\loigiai{\na) $ 5^{300} = \\left( 5^{3} \\right)^{100}  = 125^{100}$\\\\\n$ 3^{500} = \\left( 3^{5} \\right)^{100}  =  243^{100}$\\\\\nVì $ 125 < 243$ nên $ 125^{100} < 243^{100} $ suy ra $ 5^{300} < 3^{500}$.\\\\\nb) $505^{303} = \\left( 505^{3} \\right)^{101}$\\\\\nTa có $505^{3}= 5^{3} \\cdot 101^{3} = 125 \\cdot 101^{3}$\\\\\n$303^{505} = \\left( 303^{5} \\right)^{101}$\\\\\nTa có $303^{5}= 3^{5} \\cdot 101^{5} = 243 \\cdot 101^{5}$\\\\\nVì $ 125 < 243$ nên $5^{3} \\cdot 101^{3} < 3^{5} \\cdot 101^{5}$\\\\\nSuy ra $505^{303} < 303^{505}$